==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|súrr}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*sūraz}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*súHros}}. Compare {{cog|en|sour}}, {{cog|de|sauer}}, {{cog|nl|zuur}}, {{cog|da|sur}}, {{cog|fo|súrur}}, {{cog|no|sur}} and {{cog|sv|sur}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/suːr/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|uːr|s=1}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj/old|súrari|súrastur}}

# [[sour]], [[tart]], [[acid]], [[acidic]]
# [[surly]], [[bitter]], [[morose]], [[sour]] {{q|of mood}}
#: {{ux|is|Ekki vera svona '''súr'''.|Don't be so '''morose'''.}}

====Declension====
{{is-decl-adj-1|s|ú|r}}

